+# Merge-chain Fleet-PRE exact-SHA gate (GAP B) — 2026-09-16
+
+## Task
+Implement the permanent merge-chain Fleet-PRE exact-SHA enforcement gate
+(Architect OWNER_DELTA / GAP B, issued 2026-09-16 and repeatedly since
+2026-09-14): no PR head may be integrated without an exact-SHA
+`READY_FOR_OCEAN` Fleet PRE certificate.
+
+## Why
+Weakest CLAIM_TRUTH control-plane pillar. Integration historically proceeded
+with zero independent exact-SHA Fleet PRE certificates (`#116/#117/#121`
+merged without certs; repeated `#91/#113` false-green class). `git grep` over
+`scripts/ lib/ test/ .github/` returns zero enforcement occurrences today.
+Confirmed-error-twice => permanent regression-guard candidate. Pure
+CI/scripts/tests/data/docs delta; no app/game/runtime change, no production
+deploy, no Vercel build (non-deployable paths).
+
+## Current state
+Fresh branch from `origin/master` `414179ea` (canonical default HEAD; LKG =
+`414179ea`). No prior Builder commits pushed for this lane. GAP B confirmed
+open on the exact head (whole-tree grep = 0 enforcement occurrences).
+
+## Target state
+A pure-Node fail-closed certificate validator + a `fleet-pre-merge-chain`
+GitHub Actions check that is green ONLY when a fresh exact-SHA
+`READY_FOR_OCEAN` certificate exists, plus regression tests inside
+`npm run check` and a bypass-class scan that forbids any no-cert/skip/
+`|| true`/fallback-green path.
+
+## Files / systems involved
+- `scripts/check-fleet-pre-certificate.cjs` (new, no deps, `module.exports`)
+- `.github/workflows/fleet-pre-merge-chain.yml` (new)
+- `test/fleet-pre-certificate.test.js` (new, inside `npm run check`)
+- `test/vercel-ignore.test.js` + `scripts/check-vercel-ignore.js` (add
+  `data/fleet-pre-certificates/` to the non-deployable prefixes so committed
+  certificates never consume Vercel quota)
+- `data/fleet-pre-certificates/README.md` (new; documents the cert schema)
+- `WORK_IN_PROGRESS.md` (this evidence)
+
+## Known risks
+Cert-source ambiguity opening a bypass -> default deterministic repo source,
+issue-80 scan available only as an explicit opt-in source, no cross-fallback.
+Adding a new required status check is an owner action; until then this gate
+is informational on the PR and must not break other lanes.
+
+## Golden systems that must be preserved
+Master protection, existing required checks (`check`, `quality-regression`,
+`agent-rules`, `world-quality`, `godot-web-preview`), Vercel quota guard,
+existing non-deployable prefix semantics for everything else.
+
+## Errors that must not return
+The `#91/#113` false-green class: cert-skip, `|| true`, `continue-on-error`,
+`if: always()` green fallback, different-SHA/stale cert accepted, silent
+fallback to a second source, and Vercel builds triggered by committed certs.
+
+## Exact patch / change plan
+1. `scripts/check-fleet-pre-certificate.cjs`: pure `evaluateCertificate`
+   (fail-closed rules 1-7) separated from I/O; `readCertFromRepo`;
+   `scanIssueCommentsForCert`; `fetchIssueComments` (https, opt-in);
+   CLI `node scripts/check-fleet-pre-certificate.cjs <headSha>` with
+   `FLEET_PRE_CERT_SOURCE=repo|issue80` (default repo) and
+   `FLEET_PRE_MAX_AGE_HOURS` (default 24).
+2. Workflow `fleet-pre-merge-chain.yml`: `pull_request:[master]` +
+   `workflow_dispatch`, `contents: read`, job `fleet-pre-merge-chain` runs
+   the validator against the PR HEAD SHA; no skip/`|| true`/fallback green.
+3. Tests: 8 fail-closed/happy rules + issue-80 scan + bypass-class workflow
+   scan (asserts no-cert path cannot be green) + Vercel ignore regression.
+4. Docs: cert schema README under `data/fleet-pre-certificates/`.
+5. Run focused + repo gates; commit; push; open PR; no merge/deploy.
+
+## Tests to run
+`node --test test/fleet-pre-certificate.test.js test/vercel-ignore.test.js`;
+`npm run check`; `node scripts/check-agent-rules.js`; `npm run golden:check`;
+`npm run quality:regression`; `node scripts/check-fleet-pre-certificate.cjs <headSha>`
+(exit 1, missing cert); `node scripts/check-vercel-ignore.js` guard checks;
+`git diff --check`; `node scripts/master-coordinator.cjs --check` if applicable.
+
+## Deployment / PR plan
+Branch `ai/master-coordinator/opencode-1789525502667-a2` -> one PR to
+`master` (one-task-one-PR). No master push, no merge, no production deploy.
+After push, Fleet PRE independently falsifies the exact HEAD_SHA; owner later
+adds `fleet-pre-merge-chain` to required status checks (TRUE_USER_ACTION_REQUIRED).
+
+## Current progress
+Bootstrap done (fresh ISSUE-80 state, exact HEAD/LKG `414179ea`, GAP B
